  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the Live version, these are indicated by icons, and by looking at the icons, it is possible to guess what the setting is (e.g., forward/backward only, etc.).\n\nIn the Beta version, these are \"Disabled\", \"One Axis\", \"Two Axis\", \"Three Axis\", and it is difficult to understand what they mean.\n\nI would like you to improve the contents of the tooltip or reconsider the selection method.\n\nAs additional information, when I translated the contents of the tooltip for this setting into Japanese, I could not understand the contents, so I actually checked the behavior and suggest adding a specific description of the direction.",
